1127 0 obj
<</Alt(Empirical data on the choruses of male Japanese tree frogs over a long time scale. \(a\) Collective transitions between the calling state and the silent state. Over a long time scale, the male frogs almost synchronize the transitions between the calling state and the silent state with each other, resulting in the formation of the collective choruses. \(b\) Histogram of the inter-chorus interval. \(c\) Histogram of the chorus duration. The inset of figure 2c shows the enlarged histogram of the chorus duration. Refer to the image caption for details.)/K 1/P 1126 0 R /Pg 206 0 R /S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
