<</Alt(Schematic diagram of a wireless sensor network. A wireless sensor network is a distributed communication system in which many sensor nodes send a data packet towards their neighbours so as to deliver the packet to a gateway node by multi-hop communication. This study aims to decrease the packet collision and power consumption, and increase connectivity in a wireless sensor network by applying our mathematical model inspired by the mechanism of frog choruses. Refer to the image caption for details.)/K 1/P 2342 0 R /Pg 395 0 R /S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
